// string they must be escaped with a literal backslash (\\[ / \\]) to be treated
// as plain text — a single backslash (\[) is rejected outright as an illegal JQL
// string escape sequence (only \\, \", \', \t, \n, \r, \<space>, \uXXXX are valid).
